    "id": "20261125-083038",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Saqlash qutisi javonga sig‘adimi?",
    "text": "📦 <b>TAOBAO: QUTI JAVONINGIZGA SIG‘ADIMI?</b>\n\nQishki buyumlar uchun quti tanlayotganda faqat rasmiga qaramang. O‘lchamlarini javoningiz bilan solishtiring.\n\n1️⃣ Javonning eni va balandligini o‘lchang.\n2️⃣ Taobao’dagi e’londan qutining o‘lchamlarini toping.\n3️⃣ Enini va balandligini javon o‘lchamlari bilan solishtiring.\n4️⃣ Qopqoq ochilishi uchun ham joy borligini tekshiring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post eslatmasi:</b>\nJavon eni → quti enidan kam bo‘lmasin\nJavon balandligi → qopqoq ochilishiga ham yetsin\n\nXariddan oldin tekshirish haqida: <a href=\"https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping\">Manba</a> va <a href=\"https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/buying-online-marketplace\">Manba</a>.\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBm2sGnZX3UU1YyTH0lLk8Rpl9cr_PAAKIFmsbYB04VLwkHvGWBYFZAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261125-083038/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Saqlash qutisi javonga sig‘adimi?",
      "angle": "Javonning eni va balandligini e’londagi kichik quti o‘lchamlari bilan solishtiring, qopqoq ochilishi uchun joyni ham tekshiring. Kichik taqqoslash chizmasidan foydalaning.",
      "why_now": "Qishki buyumlarni tartiblashda mos quti tanlash qo‘l keladi.",
      "research": "**Tekshiruv sanasi: 2026-yil 25-noyabr.** Quyidagi mavzular qish oldi va sovg‘a xaridlariga mos. Maslahatlar umumiy xarid tavsiyalariga asoslangan; mahsulot tafsiloti va shartlarini har bir e’londa alohida tekshirish kerak.\n\n1. **Taobao: Saqlash qutisi javonga sig‘adimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Javonning eni va balandligini o‘lchang, qutining e’londagi o‘lchamlari bilan solishtiring. Qopqoq ochilishi uchun ham joy borligini tekshiring. **Format:** kichik taqqoslash chizmasi.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Qishki buyumlarni tartiblashda qo‘l keladi.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([assets.publishing.service.gov.uk](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693056fe0cf0b7e681ff41b3/opss-research-into-consumer-behaviour-on-online-marketplaces.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Poizon: Krossovkaning model kodi siz izlaganiga mosmi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Istalgan krossovkaning model kodini toping va e’londagi kod bilan solishtiring. Kod ko‘rsatilmagan bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan aniqlashtiring. Bu usul o‘xshash modellarni farqlashga yordam beradi. **Format:** qisqa tekshiruv ro‘yxati.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a tanlashda tashqi ko‘rinishi o‘xshash modellarni adashtirmaslik muhim.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping?sf2589138=1&utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Pinduoduo: Bir xil buyumni qaysi sotuvchidan olish kerak?**  \n   **Burchak:** Masalan, ikkita soch qisqichi e’lonida sotuvchilar haqidagi izohlarni va qaytarish shartlarini solishtiring. Faqat narxga qarab tanlamang. **Format:** ikki ustunli jadval.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Mayda sovg‘alar tanlayotganda ham sotuvchini tekshirish foydali.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/buying-online-marketplace?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Tmall: Parda derazani yopishga yetadimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Deraza yoki karniz enini o‘lchang; e’londa pardaning eni va nechta parda berilishini tekshiring. Keyin kerakli kenglik bilan solishtiring. **Format:** oddiy o‘lchash chizmasi.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Qish oldidan uy jihozlarini yangilayotganlar uchun amaliy.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([assets.publishing.service.gov.uk](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693056fe0cf0b7e681ff41b3/opss-research-into-consumer-behaviour-on-online-marketplaces.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Taobao: Yig‘ilgan soyabon sumkangizga sig‘adimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** E’londan soyabonning *yig‘ilgan holatdagi* uzunligini toping va sumkangiz ichidagi bo‘sh joy bilan solishtiring. O‘lcham topilmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rang. **Format:** rasmli maslahat.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Yomg‘irli va qorli kunlar uchun kichik soyabon tanlashda foydali.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/buying-online-marketplace?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Poizon: Tanlangan krossovkani qaytarish sharti qanday?**  \n   **Burchak:** Buyurtmani tasdiqlashdan oldin aynan tanlangan mahsulotning qaytarish shartini o‘qing. Tushunarsiz joyi bo‘lsa, oldindan so‘rang; barcha mahsulotning sharti bir xil deb o‘ylamang. **Format:** uch bandli tekshiruv ro‘yxati.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a xaridida oluvchiga mahsulot yoqmasligi yoki mos kelmasligi mumkin.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 10/10. ([agreement.dewu.com](https://agreement.dewu.com/client/view?from=5f83ff7b57c2c0780741fd42&id=127AG56CG1DDA&utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Taobao: Sumkaning yelkabogi sizga qulaymi?**  \n   **Burchak:** E’londa yelkabog‘ uzunligi va sozlanishi ko‘rsatilganini tekshiring. Uni o‘zingizga qulay sumka bog‘i bilan solishtiring; ma’lumot yetmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rang. **Format:** yonma-yon chizma.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Qalin ustki kiyim bilan taqiladigan sumka tanlashda qulaylik muhim.  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/buying-online-marketplace?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Pinduoduo: Dasturxon stolning qaysi joyigacha tushadi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Stolning eni va uzunligini o‘lchang. E’londagi dasturxon o‘lchami bilan solishtirib, chetlardan qancha mato o",
